      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Two case reports are presented of patients with post-thoracotomy pain treated with epidural morphine who developed somnolence several hours after the procedure. Physostigmine, 1 mg IV successfully reversed the somnolence without any effect on analgesia."},
